	<Item Name="title" Type="String">Effect of venetoclax, tedizolid, and combination treatment on gene expression in a venetoclax-resistant AML cell line</Item>
	<Item Name="summary" Type="String">The goal of this study was to profile the changes in gene expression in an AML cell line with acquired resistance to venetoclax in response to treatment with venetoclax, tedizolid, or combination of the 2 drugs.</Item>
